{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "aee093c1-f3b2-8dbf-a73e-9a5fedff186f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T12:27:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carol Gifford",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:23:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:23:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin. Yes, I'm calling about a streetlight. It's out near me, well, not out exactly. It flickers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:23:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Flickers. Okay. So it's on and off, not just dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:23:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On and off, yes. It does it all night long. On and off, on and off. It's been going on about a week now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:23:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week. Alright, let me pull up a form here. What's the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:24:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of my house, 233 Dixon Street. That's in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:24:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "233 Dixon Street. Got it. And is it on a utility pole or is it a standalone city light post?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:24:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A pole. A wooden pole, the light's on an arm sticking out over the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:24:28-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On a wooden pole, with an arm. Okay, there should be a number tag on the pole, maybe a metal tag or a sticker, about eye level or a little above. Could you see one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:24:44-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, let me look. I'm on my cell, I'll walk out. [pause] Okay, I'm at the pole. I see a little tag, but it's pretty faded."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:24:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Faded. Yeah, that happens. Can you read any of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:25:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not really. Something that might be a four, and then it's worn off. I'd be guessing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:25:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Might be a four. No worries, don't guess. The address and the description will do. I'll note it's the pole in front of 233, arm light, flickering overnight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:25:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Flickering overnight, yes. Could you have a crew check the pole? I don't know if it's the bulb or something in the wiring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:25:33-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Have a crew check the pole. Yep, that's what I'll put in. They'll look at the fixture and figure out whether it's the lamp or something else. If it turns out to be the utility's equipment, it might get passed along to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:25:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Passed along to them. Okay. That's fine, as long as somebody looks at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:25:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Is it bothering you inside, like through the windows?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:04-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little, yes. It lights up the front room and then it doesn't. I'm in the middle of a jigsaw puzzle on the dining table, and one piece is missing, so I've been up looking for it under the flickering. Not helping."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a jigsaw puzzle with a missing piece. That'll do it. I'll put that the flicker is pretty constant overnight so they know it's not occasional."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Constant overnight, yes. That's accurate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Do you want a call back when it's done, or just let them take care of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A call back would be nice. My number is 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0185. And that's Carol?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Carol Gifford. G-I-F-F-O-R-D."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:57-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gifford, got it. Carol Gifford, 233 Dixon, flickering arm light on a wooden pole, crew to inspect. I'm sending that over now. Usually it's within a week or so, a bit longer if it's the utility."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:27:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week or so. Alright. That's all I needed. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:27:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Carol. Happy New Year, and good luck finding that puzzle piece."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:27:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye now."
    }
  ],
